@startuml
title D07 - Independent Project B candidate and overflow update
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif

start
:Read accepted generic parent domains and current UID order;

if (Membership / source policy changed?) then (yes)
  :Identify affected receiver clusters;
  :Rebuild their complete accepted candidate sets C;
else (no)
  :Reuse cached candidate membership;
endif

if (Affected proposals need rebuilding?) then (yes)
  :Rank useful fast set H with at most 128 sources;
  :Keep every other candidate in T = C minus H;
  :Build supported tail aliases and branch probability;
  :Invalidate only changed fast-slot attribution safely;
else (no)
  :Reuse supported proposals and actual stored probabilities;
endif

:Pass CPU UID tables to existing LightManager publisher;
if (UID/index order or table generation changed?) then (yes)
  :Resolve UIDs and refresh current GPU indices;
else (no)
  :Reuse matching index publication;
endif

if (Union, PDFs, indices and budgets valid?) then (yes)
  :Publish complete fast / tail table data;
  :Return p_source including selected branch probability;
  :Report demand before truncation and branch occupancy;
else (no)
  :Report failure; do not publish an incomplete tail;
  stop
endif

note right
  C = H union T; H intersection T is empty.
  UID conversion reuses existing publication.
  No dependency on DTAL grid or member geometry.
end note
stop
@enduml
